#!/usr/bin/env bun
/**
 * LANTIVO — CANIBALIZATION POLICY — IDENTITY/DEDUP + FILTER EQUIVALENCE GATE V1
 *
 * AUDIT HARNESS ONLY. Imports the pinned production TypeScript as the semantic
 * oracle. It never writes GitHub/R2/manifest/Supabase/Lovable and never modifies
 * the runtime checkout. Network access is restricted to GET of the optional
 * employee-cell lookup exposed by the already-snapshotted manifest; GET results
 * are cached locally and hashed in the final evidence.
 *
 * Two explicit study constructions (NOT runtime claims):
 *  1) Nationalization of runtime-local dedupe: tile the country by Radar home
 *     cell, run the exact runtime pipeline on that cell's 5x5/2km window, and
 *     retain only survivors whose home cell is the tile being emitted.
 *  2) Entity↔entity spacing: MIN haversine over all surviving member pairs.
 *
 * Both are measured against a global relevant-name dedupe diagnostic. Any
 * context-dependent delta is reported and blocks automatic policy calibration.
 */

